# Build output — never ship the host's bin/obj into the image (stale/other-arch).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/

# IDE / tooling
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/*.user

# Secrets. `dotnet user-secrets` writes outside the repo, but an appsettings
# override dropped next to a project would be baked into the image and read at
# runtime — the container gets its configuration from the environment.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/*.env
.env
.env.*

# Not needed to publish Govori.Api / Govori.Worker
tests/
init-solution.sh
**/*.md

# Docker artefacts (the builder reads the Dockerfile out-of-band)
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.gitignore
